This is a clean-room rewrite of the Riccon Agents idea. The previous
implementation (https://github.com/ai-riccon/riccon-agents), also
Apache-2.0, was used as a design reference. No source code from that
repository is copied into this one; the state/handoff/gate/evidence
concepts and the project name are retained.
